# EXPLAIN is followed by the digest of the explained statement. A statement that
# doesn't parse is not recorded.
> EXPLAIN SELECT * FROM t WHERE id = 1
!> EXPLAIN SELECT * FROM nosuch
!> EXPLAIN EXPLAIN SELECT 1
---
Error: invalid input: table nosuch does not exist
